  "usefulExpressions":{"units":[
    {"unitId":"unit-1","printedPage":89,"entries":[["Listen carefully! You must stay in the bus. Don't go outside.","请认真听：你们必须待在（观光）巴士里。不要出去。",""],["Yes, sir. Can we touch the animals?","好的，先生。我们能摸动物吗？",""],["No. Don't touch the animals. You must keep your hands inside the bus.","不可以。不要触碰动物。你们必须把手放在车内。",""],["What's the guard doing?","那位保安在干什么？",""],["He's telling people what to do.","他在告诉人们（该）做什么。",""],["Is he coming over here?","他是朝这边走来了吗？",""],["Yes, he is.","是的，他是。",""]]},{"unitId":"unit-2","printedPage":89,"entries":[["Is there a bookshop near here?","附近有书店吗？",""],["Yes, there is. Walk along this street. Turn right at the police station. The bookshop is on your right.","是的，（附近）有。沿着这条街走。在警察局右转。书店在你的右侧。",""],["Is there also a library near here?","附近也有图书馆吗？",""],["No, there isn't.","不，（附近）没有。",""],["What does she teach?","她教什么？",""],["She teaches maths.","她教数学。",""],["Who's Mr Zhang? What does he do?","张先生是谁？他做什么工作？",""],["He's a street cleaner.","他是街道清洁工。",""]]},{"unitId":"unit-3","printedPage":89,"entries":[["Which season do you like the best, children?","孩子们，你们最喜欢哪个季节？",""],["I like spring the best. The weather is nice. I often fly a kite with my father in the park.","我最喜欢春天。（春天）天气好。我经常和爸爸在公园里放风筝。",""],["Class, what's the best time of year?","同学们，一年中最好的时节是什么时候？",""],["I think it's autumn.","我认为是秋天。",""],["When's Dongzhi?","冬至在什么时候？",""],["It's in winter. We celebrate Dongzhi in late December.","它在冬天。我们在十二月底过冬至。",""]]},{"unitId":"unit-4","printedPage":90,"entries":[["What's your hometown famous for?","你的家乡因什么而著名？",""],["It's the home of Confucius.","它是孔子的故乡。",""],["What are some other famous places in China?","中国还有哪些著名的地方？",""],["China has many famous places. Sichuan is famous for its pandas.","中国有许多著名的地方。四川因大熊猫而著名。",""],["What makes Australia special?","什么让澳大利亚与众不同？",""],["The good weather and beautiful beaches.","好天气和美丽的海滩。",""]]},{"unitId":"unit-5","printedPage":90,"entries":[["How do you come to school?","你怎么来上学？",""],["I often come by bus.","我经常坐公交车来（上学）。",""],["Where are you going?","你要去哪里？",""],["I'm going to my dance class.","我要去上舞蹈课。",""],["Are you going by bus?","你要乘公交车去吗？",""],["Yes.","是的。",""],["What are you going to do?","你打算做什么？",""],["I'm going to visit my grandparents.","我打算去看望我的爷爷奶奶。",""]]},{"unitId":"unit-6","printedPage":90,"entries":[["Where are you going in the summer holidays, Zhang Peng?","张鹏，你暑假打算去哪里？",""],["I'm going to Dalian with my family.","我要和家人去大连。",""],["When are you going to Dalian?","你打算什么时候去大连？",""],["In July.","在七月。",""],["How can we make a good travel plan?","我们如何制订一个好的旅游计划？",""],["Well, first, we need to choose where to go.","嗯，首先，我们需要选择去哪里。",""],["Then we need to choose how to get there.","然后我们需要选择如何到那里。",""],["Next, we should look for hotels.","下一步，我们要找宾馆。",""],["Finally, we should find out about the weather.","最后，我们要查一查天气。",""]]}
  ]},
